#Week 3 – Dashboard Development

## Overview

This stage of the Excelerate Data Analytics Internship focused on transforming exploratory analysis into an interactive Power BI dashboard that communicates meaningful business insights.

## Dashboard Highlights

- Executive KPI Cards
- Opportunity Creation Trend
- Opportunity Distribution by Category
- Application Distribution by Location
- Average Opportunity Duration
- Scholarship Distribution
- Median Application Fee Analysis
- Auto Approval Distribution
- Current Type Distribution
- Interactive Slicers (Category & Location)

## Tools Used

- Microsoft Power BI Desktop – Dashboard development and interactive visualisation
- Microsoft Excel – Data preparation and validation
- Microsoft Word – Insights report preparation
- Google Docs – Report drafting and collaboration

## Dashboard Files

- Opportunity_Dashboard.pbix
- Opportunity_Dashboard.pdf

## Key Skills Demonstrated

- Dashboard Design
- Data Visualisation
- Business Intelligence
- KPI Development
- Data Storytelling
- Interactive Reporting
